      "purpose": "`queue` is a consolidated worker queue with owned implementations for in-memory, Redis Pub/Sub, Redis Streams, Valkey Streams, NATS, and NSQ. It preserves the recognizable `golang-queue` programming model while owning correctness, operations, and releases in one module. RabbitMQ compatibility is released independently from the `rabbitmq` nested module.",
